[70.079883, "o", "proposed 5729ff8f2fa2b2f3f2571ac3ee0e47c3 as agent-derived; `ljos accept 5729ff8f2fa2b2f3f2571ac3ee0e47c3` writes it\r\n"]
[70.079941, "o", "did not fire the island for \"Ship the fuse change\": its seeds are hits no two scorers agreed on; wiring them would tighten the wrong links\r\ncompleted the session node for demo-hreh as done\r\nthe ticket demo-hreh keeps its state; `ljos finish demo-hreh --close` or `vissue update demo-hreh -s DONE` closes it when the work is accepted\r\ntracker git: committed chore(issues): demo-hreh finished; not pushed (LJOS_TRACKER_GIT=commit)\r\n"]
